  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Evil Death Roll** (1 other source): The performance included a partial version of the song Invisible Face [1]\n- **Cellophane** (1 other source): The setlist incorporated fragments of Alter Me, Hot Water, and I'm in Your Mind [1]\n- Bits of the track Head On/Pill were played during the concert [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Anoxia**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: All Is Known [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2017-04-01.mysteryjack** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 89 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2017-04-01.mysteryjack**: taped by @mysteryjackofficial; transferred by @mysteryjackofficial; source: TASCAM DR-40 (Internal Cardioid Mics @ 24bit/48kHz WAV- XY Pattern- Deck mounted on balcony railing, house right. Approximately 25 yards back from the stage.… [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2017-04-01 Webster Hall, New York, NY, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-april-1-2017-webster-hall-new-york-ny-usa.html) [4]",
